  "script": "The 2023 Porsche Panamera Turbo S packs a powerful punch with 690 horsepower. That\u2019s a huge number for a luxury sedan, and it outshines many sports cars. The brilliant Michael Mauer, led by Wolfgang Hatz, crafted this stunning model, blending performance and luxury like never before. Its design legacy is a seamless continuation of Porsche's heritage. Under the hood, a twin-turbocharged 4.0-liter V8 engine dominates. It roars with authority, propelling the Panamera from 0 to 60 mph in just 2.9 seconds. Thanks to its advanced all-wheel-drive system, the Panamera Turbo S delivers precise handling on any terrain without sacrificing comfort. Starting around $186,000 new, the Panamera Turbo S holds its value well, trading for about $160,000 today. Stack it up against the Mercedes-AMG GT 63 S, which offers 630 horsepower. The Panamera\u2019s extra grunt makes a definite impact in straight-line speed. But would you choose the Panamera Turbo S for its unmatched performance, or do you lean towards another luxury competitor? Tell us your pick!",
